        "missing": "None of them show the reference's arching, drooping lower fronds — every frond is held straight and radial, so the crown stays flat and sparse instead of forming a dense, hanging skirt. All also lack the reference's leaflet density and its textured trunk of leaf-base scars, and the longer-frond renders bought their crowns at the cost of a wavy, uneven trunk the reference never has.",
